# 190fee6 is upstream feat/cp2k-arm: main 7fa9046 plus the CP2K arm
# (CP2KParams, PotentialSpec.cp2k @6, PotentialConfig.cp2k @17).
# rgpot-local neighbour chunk: ForceInput.neighbors @9,
# PotentialResult.neighborList @28, Potential.neighbours @13 and the
# NeighborRequest, NeighborSystem and NeighborList structs. Upstream has
# none of these yet. The diff may only add lines; Potentials.ordinals
# records what it adds, and the ledger check refuses a diff that edits
# or removes an ordinal line.
diff_files = neighbour-chunk.diff
